      "warnings": [
        "This is Ethereum pJar 0c/pCurve 3pool, not its gauge, strategy, other jar or raw DAI/USDC/USDT pool. Official mapping identifies Curve 3CRV LP underlying; full source is bound independently to this direct deployment.",
        "Deposit amounts are underlying token units; withdrawal amounts are jar shares. DepositAll spends caller entire underlying balance subject to allowance; withdrawAll burns caller entire share balance. Outputs/shares go to caller; all admitted methods require zero native value.",
        "Deposit accounting uses actual received balance delta and floor-rounded shares. A small positive deposit can mint zero shares; no minimum shares/output or caller-set deadline is provided. Share price is not a guaranteed 1:1 exchange.",
        "Withdrawals burn shares before asking mutable controller for shortfall and can reduce payout to actual returned funds. Controller/strategy failure, rounding, fees and taxed/nonstandard transfers can affect receipts or revert operations.",
        "Historical official strategy listing is attribution, not proof of current strategy configuration, yield, backing, liquidity or execution. Source/ABI admission does not attest fresh runtime identity or financial safety and creates no API-key grant or execution-control bypass."
      ]
